{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_07",
  "title": "Who You Callin' Pet?",
  "storyCode": "AS-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "762c1fb8ad218bc4a40ee81f939e085d3518cb3194565765abe5f322f0ad123c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey! Watch where you're going!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "S-Sorry, effendi! I was in a hurry. Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, I supposed nothing's broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where are you off to in such a hurry? Don't you know there's trouble?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "First those metal constructs sent all the gems in the city to the Great Bazaar, now they're tearing down houses and chasing us out of the bazaar."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The constructs are tearing down houses?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Yeah! There are flying stones and debris everywhere.\nHey, why are you still going that way? Didn't you hear what I said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I need to see what's going on!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you think you can do, girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, girl!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...No one's here. They've all gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By Horakhet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The streets, usually bustling with people, are now empty, save for constructs moving in pairs or triplets.\nThey raise their arms, and houses turn into sand.\nFrom the fallen sand, tall pillars and walls emerge."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yikes, that almost hit me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mio",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Meow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who was that...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mio",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mrow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh, where did this critter come from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mio",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Meow!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go, this is no place for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pepe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go! Shoo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mio",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The animal is not daunted by her shooing and instead sits down to leisurely lick its own fur.\nA suspicious Pepe decides to go around it. As she takes a step, the animal looks up and gazes straight into Pepe's eyes.\nIn that instant, Pepe feels as though her feet have become nailed to the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But it is such a small animal.\nShe gathers the courage to take another step forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A deafening roar stops her. She feels her eardrums hurt.\nShe cannot imagine the sound coming from a tiny animal that barely reaches her shins.\nShe covers her ears and closes her eyes, wincing as the sound wave almost knocks her over.\nAs her ears stop ringing, she feels a massive shadow descending upon her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pepe opens her eyes to see a formidable creature prowling in the middle of the street, faint patterns with a wondrous gleam roving upon its sandy fur.\nTransfixed, she meets the beast's gaze and feels as though her very soul is being drawn into those golden eyes.\nHer breath and heartbeat seem to fall under its control, ready to cease at its will.\nUnable to move a single muscle, she watches helplessly as the beast slowly approaches, its crimson maw parting...\nAnd swallows her whole."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "All goes dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anat, Acting Curator of Varjavandabad Museum. Yes, we are aware, but unfortunately we do not have the resources..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our experts are being deployed across the city. We do not currently have the manpower to assess your losses..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course we value your sponsorship, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anat, Acting Curator of Varjavandabad Museum... no, we are unable to offer any comment at this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...What? No, the museum is already on lockdown. No collection can leave the building."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The museum has nothing to do with the constructs in the city...\nHello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anat, Acting Curator of Varjavandabad Museum..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*cough* *cough* Sorry, we're getting a lot of sand and dust here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I assure you, on behalf of Varjavandabad Museum that we will offer restoration services at the earliest opportunity..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*cough* *cough* ...Appraisal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The constructs have built a statue in your garden? And several pillars? May I have a description?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Yes, the ornaments you described fit the traits of first-century art style. It had gone into decline prior to the founding of Menat-Ha'mait, and many of its techniques are considered lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will send someone as soon as possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Titi, can you go over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you think it's possible? That the constructs can build, sculpt, and master techniques believed to be long lost?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't want to, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks like you have a bad feeling about it too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Which is why we need to see it to believe it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What is it, Titi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You said 'see it to believe it', right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Carried by the dry winds, sand creeps up like an overflowing river, covering the feet of fleeing passersby.\nGrains of sand gather before their eyes and form into shapes, as though poured into invisible molds.\nPillars and walls begin to rise from the streets."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Beast reliefs and patterns imitating Originium circuits, coupled with the worship of sundials and time, representative of the era when Lugalszargus's influence was at its strongest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Titi, now's not a good time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This might be the 'memory' of the constructs. Can it even be counted as a form of restored artifact?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But we didn't see any constructs nearby—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Ruuuuun!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where did they come from, anyway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*pant* *pant* Questions later, Titi! You've got to run faster than me, and pull me along!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We... we're done for if we run at my speed!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry, you're running fast enough. Hang in there, try not to pass out, and let me observe them a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, and don't look back. Probably not good for your heart to see them smashing the curator's favorite murals to pieces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wh-What?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The museum that the curator entrusted to me... the padishah's favorite museum... it's all over..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have mercy on me, Shahanshah! Watch over me, Exalted Lugalszargus!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medjehtiqedti",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Watch out—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anat",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Great Horakhet, I pray to you again! Allow your child to see your face again! I-I want to see the sunrise tomorrow! I want to see it shine once more on the museum!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The babbling Anat trips and falls.\nTiti catches her just before her face hits the ground, but the two of them hear a loud noise.\nIt sounds like a machine turning on."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajani",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*pant* *pant* Narantuya! We finally found you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajazi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We haven't heard from you since you bought us drinks last night! We were so worried!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I haven't had a shut-eye in days, so I slept in longer. What's there to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anyway, good timing. Give me a hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajazi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why are you still helping other people carry stuff?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shh, I'm not doing this for anyone else, it's for myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is obviously an old statue. Better to get something out of it than to just leave it on the streets."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajani",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But Narantuya... Isn't it made by one of the metal constructs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? What metal constructs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lay it out for me slowly. I might have slept too soundly last night and missed some headlines."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajazi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought you were the sharp one, Narantuya. How could you have missed it? There are weird metal constructs all over the street. Didn't they come at you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajazi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're tearing houses apart, making walls and pillars out of sand... and grabbing gems. Maybe you should check?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajazi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone lost something last night, from onyx necklaces on their necks to astrolabes that simulate the moons and stars."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is that what happened to your hairpin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajazi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wha... where did my hairpin go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You got one thing right, I'm sharper than you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I'm starting to feel that something is off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anyway, now that I have the intel, time to come up with a plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Take off any gems you're wearing and hide them. If those metal constructs are robbers, let them come for me first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Join the fleeing crowds and get your smoke bombs ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajani",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But where do we go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajani",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone else can hide in their homes or at least stay in hotels behind locked doors. Are... we going back to the sewers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajazi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No problem, I know the way. I'll help us find our sleeping bags."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... we're going back to the museum."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajani",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The museum? How could that place be safe when they'll hire people like me and Ajazi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Think about it. Who are the experts on caravan routes, desert terrain, dune movement, burdenbeast habits, and tribal faiths? Bandits, meaning us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, who are the experts on the dead coming back to life, ancient curses, and necromancy? The museum folks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajani",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Makes sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I hear something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Perfect timing. I want to see what those metal constructs are all about."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Alright I get it now. Let's go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajazi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are we practicing our escape?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, this IS the escape!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's hope smoke bombs work on these things!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She turns around, raises her hand, and prepares to pull the pin on the smoke bomb—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Suddenly, the streets grow quiet.\nThe sound of marching machines disappears.\nAll the metal constructs Narantuya can see slow down.\nThey stop chasing them and gather around Narantuya."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Calm and docile, they watch like tamed burdenbeasts as Narantuya walks past them.\n—And back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What the hey...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Am I dreaming?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajazi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not a dream, Narantuya. I pinched myself just now. It hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thanks. Then I won't try it myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Say... I saw a shadow of the river god the night before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe it really did bless me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I understand now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ajazi, Ajani, go on to the museum without me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ajani",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Divine duty. I need to find someone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Narantuya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The river god must have wanted me to act the hero, and show Aspasia that I'm the boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Woof",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Those who stand by me need no longer be enemies of your warriors.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Woof",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The jewel constructs are following the pact of the two human sovereigns a thousand years ago. They recognize her blood..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Woof",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You were right, Zubayr. She is the descendant of Kharanduu Khagan."
